missing source                                 skip: the source is missing
folder to nothing in the domain                make a domain folder
folder to a local folder                       make a local folder
folder onto a local file                       skip: a file holds the folder's name at the target
folder onto a domain file                      skip: a file holds the folder's name at the target
domain file onto a local folder                skip: a folder holds the file's name at the target
local file onto a domain folder                skip: a folder holds the file's name at the target
domain file to nothing in the domain           copy the manifest f
domain file to nothing, moved                  rename f in the domain
domain file onto the same content              identical
domain file onto other content                 copy the manifest f
domain file onto the same content, moved       identical; the source is dropped
local file to nothing in the domain            upload, fresh
local file equal to the domain's               identical
local file differing from the domain's         upload, replacing
unhashed local file onto a domain file         upload, replacing
local link equal to the domain's               identical
local link onto a domain file                  upload, replacing
domain file to nothing locally                 assemble f
domain file onto an equal local file           identical
